Learning not to gain levels so quickly would be a big help to you in
avoiding so many annoying deaths. If you had simply run away from the
Kops (or not summoned them in the first place) you'd probably have
survived a lot further through the game.

You need to balance level gains with the equipment you find: jumping from 
level 3 to 6 will increase the difficulty of the monsters you face so 
unless you match it with appropriate armour and weapons you won't last 
long.


